# Store text with LF and let Git hand out native endings on checkout. Without this, a clone on
# another system shows every file as wholly changed the first time it is touched.
* text=auto

# Visual Studio rewrites these with CRLF whatever the repository says, so agree with it rather
# than fight it every time the solution is opened.
*.sln text eol=crlf

# Artwork, and the sprites the mods embed. Never to be treated as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
